wse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". You can target any number of opponents who are clearly visible and who are within 6 squares of you. Each target beyond the first imposes a -5 penalty on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check. You roll just once to set the DC for your opponents' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," checks. Any opponent whose roll you beat is treated as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against the first attack you make against them in the next round.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," checks to Feint while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},". Add your Vehicle's size modifier (see below) and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," modifier to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check, and take a -5 penalty if you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," skill. If you successfully Feint against a target, it is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against only your first attack, not those of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MODIFIER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"],"rowspan":3},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MODIFIER\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Large\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gargantuan\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-15\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Huge\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-20\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
